  "title": "Delhi Police Files FIRs Over CJP's 'Lehra Do Tiranga' Protest",
  "summary": "Delhi Police registered multiple FIRs in connection with alleged violation of prohibitory orders in Connaught Place ahead of the Cockroach Janta Party's 'Lehra Do Tiranga' protest a day ago, sources said. A crowd gathered in and around Connaught Place on Friday, prompting the police to initiate legal action. The prohibitory orders, issued under Section 163 of the Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita, banned mass gatherings in Connaught Place and adjoining areas.",
